# Loaded automatically by `bun test`. Vite injects BASE_URL as a build-time constant
# (see vite.config.ts's `base`); bun test has no bundler pass, so router.tsx's
# `import.meta.env.BASE_URL` would otherwise read undefined. Setting it as a real
# process env var (rather than mutating it from a preload script) is what makes it survive
# `bun test --isolate`, which gives each test file a fresh global snapshot.
BASE_URL=/
